  "solution": "We consider each option and solve the given equation using BODMAS rule:**\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b968da625e3936f9364a60f4ec3bdc8f1d4b1d1db9850270d1f3b4f0822dfd51.png] \n\nOption 1) 3 and 9 ; + and ÷ \n\n27 + 3 - 63 × __**9 ÷ 10**__ = 78\n\n27 + 3 - __**63 × 0.9**__ = 78\n\n__**27 + 3**__ - 56.7 = 78\n\n__**30 - 56.7**__ = 78\n\n-26.7 ≠ 78\n\nOption 2) 63 and 10 ; + and -\n__**27 ÷ 9 **__+ 10 × 3 - 63 = 78\n\n3 + __**10**____** × 3**__ - 63 = 78\n\n__**3 +**____** 3**0__ - 63 = 78\n\n__**33 -**____** 63**__ = 78\n\n-30 ≠ 78\n\nOption 3) 27 and 63 ; + and -\n__**63 ÷ 9**__ + 27 × 3 - 10 = 78\n\n7 + __**27**____** × 3**__ - 10 = 78\n\n__**7 + **____81__** - 10 = 78**\n__**88 -**____** 10**__ = 78\n\n78 = 78\n\nOption 4) 9 and 10 ; × and +\n__**27 ÷ 10**__ - 63 + 3 × 9 = 78\n\n2.7 - 63 + __**3 × 9**__ = 78\n\n__**2.7**__ - 63 __**+ **____27__** = 78\n\n29.7 - 63 = 78\n\n-33.3 ≠ 78\n\nHence **the correct answer is option 3)**",
